{
 "title": "Moon",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Moon",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c578",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Now cut back to Huntsville, July 16, 1969.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c579",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In Florida, the Saturn V, the rocket designed",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c580",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "in Alabama, lifts off with three astronauts on",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c581",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "top.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c582",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Four days later, a human being steps onto",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c583",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the moon.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c584",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Four years after Bloody Sunday.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c585",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Same state.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c586",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So here is the answer to the question",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c587",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "from the very beginning.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c588",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "How does one state do both?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c589",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Because the rocket and the bridge were the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c590",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "same kind of story.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c591",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Ordinary people in Alabama decided that the line",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c592",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "everyone said they could never cross was not",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c593",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the end of the road.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c594",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "One group did it with engineering.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c595",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The other did it with their feet.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c596",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And a third group did it with a",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c597",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "song.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c598",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Remember that town of 14,000 people from",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c599",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the very start?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c600",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Muscle Shoals on the Tennessee River in the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c601",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "far north?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c602",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In the 1960s, a little studio there called",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c603",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "FAME started making hits.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c604",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Wilson Pickett recorded Mustang Sally there.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c605",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1967, a young singer named Aretha Franklin",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c606",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "walked in, sat down at the piano, and",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c607",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "cut the song that made her a star.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c608",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The house band were local white musicians.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c609",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They called themselves the Swampers.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c610",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In a state that was fighting to keep",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c611",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Black and white people apart, they were in",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c612",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a room every day making Black soul music",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c613",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "with Black singers.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c614",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The story goes that when one famous New",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c615",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "York songwriter tried to hire the Black musicians",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c616",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "he'd heard on those records, he was told",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c617",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "they were four white guys from Alabama.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c618",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in December 1969, five months after the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c619",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "moon landing, the Rolling Stones quietly drove into",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c620",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "town and recorded Brown Sugar and Wild Horses",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c621",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "there.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c622",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Most of the locals had no idea.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c623",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the five blocks have one more stop.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c624",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "1979.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c625",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "George Wallace, the man who promised segregation forever,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c626",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "now in a wheelchair after an assassination attempt,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c627",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "asked to be wheeled into Dr. King's old",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c628",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "church on Dexter Avenue.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c629",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In front of the congregation, he apologized.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c630",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He said he had learned what suffering means.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c631",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And he asked for their forgiveness.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c632",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Some people forgave him.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c633",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Some never did.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c634",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Both are fair.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c635",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But he went back.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c636",
     "shot": "todo_moon",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And he asked, on that same street.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}